@startuml 11-model-blocks
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
hide empty members
hide circle
title boussole-format — the blocks of a session (package model.block)

interface Block <<sealed>> {
  +position() : Position
}
class Prose <<record>> {
  markdown : String
}
interface InlineDirective <<sealed>>
class TermMention <<record>> {
  text : String
  id : Optional<String>
}
class PdfMention <<record>> {
  label : String
}
class Example <<record>> {
  label : String
}
class Recall <<record>>
class Callout <<record>>
enum CalloutKind {
  NOTE
  TIP
  WARNING
}
class Video <<record>> {
  label, youtubeId : String
  start, end : Optional<Duration>
}
class PdfRef <<record>> {
  label : String
}
class Exercise <<record>> {
  id : String
  minutes : OptionalInt
}
enum ExerciseType {
  NUMERIC
  TEXT
  FILL
  ORDER
  MATCH
  FREE
}
class Qcm <<record>> {
  id : String
  multiple : boolean
  minutes : OptionalInt
}
class Choice <<record>> {
  text : String
  correct : boolean
  feedback : Optional<String>
}
class Hint <<record>>
class Solution <<record>>
class ExerciseRef <<record>> {
  id : String
}
class Blocks <<utility>> {
  +{static} walk(List<Block>) : Stream<Block>
}
class QuestionTime <<utility>> {
  +{static} minutes(Exercise) : double
  +{static} minutes(Qcm) : double
}
class SourceRef <<record>>
interface Answer <<sealed>>
note bottom of Answer : see 12-model-answers

Block <|.. Prose
Block <|.. Example
Block <|.. Recall
Block <|.. Callout
Block <|.. Video
Block <|.. PdfRef
Block <|.. Exercise
Block <|.. Qcm
Block <|.. ExerciseRef

Prose *-- "*" InlineDirective : inlines
InlineDirective <|.. TermMention
InlineDirective <|.. PdfMention
PdfMention --> SourceRef : source
PdfRef --> SourceRef : source

Example o-- "*" Block : content
Recall o-- "*" Block : content
Callout o-- "*" Block : content
Callout --> CalloutKind : kind

Exercise --> ExerciseType : type
Exercise o-- "*" Block : statement
Exercise *-- "0..1" Answer : answer
Exercise *-- "*" Hint : hints
Exercise *-- "0..1" Solution : solution
Qcm o-- "*" Block : statement
Qcm *-- "2..*" Choice : choices
Qcm *-- "*" Hint : hints
Qcm *-- "0..1" Solution : solution
Hint o-- "*" Block : content
Solution o-- "*" Block : content

Blocks ..> Block : walks nested
QuestionTime ..> Exercise : estimates
QuestionTime ..> Qcm : estimates
@enduml
